detail:
tests/unit only covers dictionary.py. Add CPU unit tests that:
- run one update() step for each trainer (Standard, Gated, PAnneal, GatedAnneal, TopK, BatchTopK, Matryoshka, JumpReLU) on random data;
- check that decoder norms stay at 1 where they are constrained;
- check that AutoEncoderTopK, BatchTopKSAE and MatryoshkaBatchTopKSAE round-trip through state_dict;
- check that scale_biases scales the threshold.
Also mark tests/test_end_to_end.py to skip when CUDA or network access is unavailable, and make test_evaluation not depend on test_sae_training's outputs.
